    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that \"changing focus\" feels like a joke, you know? like trying to fix a broken engine by repainting it. everything is just a cycle. the more I \"succeed,\" the more weight there is. the more money i make, the more people expect. it's just a loop of meaningless metrics and noise. i feel like i've reached the end of the road and there's just... nothing ahead. just more of the same. it feels like there's no version of this where it actually gets better. it just gets louder and heavier.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
